    "sub_name": "國畫藝術創作",
    "sub_ename": "TRADITIONAL CHINESE PAINTING ART CREATION",
    "describe_ch": "引導學生對傳統水墨的認識，並透過基礎筆墨練習，能欣賞古典書畫之美，再引申對當代水墨畫的理解，並?發學生的水墨涵養。",
    "describe_eh": "Guide students to understand traditional ink and wash, and through basic pen and ink exercises, they can appreciate the beauty of classical painting and calligraphy, then extend their understanding of contemporary ink and wash painting, and inspire students to cultivate ink and wash.",
